+class EventletAdaptedEvent:
+    """An eventlet event adapted to the :class:`threading.Event` API.
+
+    :class:`eventlet.event.Event` can only be sent once and has neither
+    ``is_set()`` nor ``set()``, while waiting on a :class:`threading.Event`
+    blocks the whole hub (unless monkey patched) so other green threads
